- **Depends on:** Tables `app_secrets`, `pdpl_requests`, `leads`, `quotes`, `customers`, `inquiries`; storage buckets `supplier-docs`, `drawing-files`, `quote-files`; RPC `fn_pdpl_redact`; secret `inbound_secret`.
