`role_guard` (blocks a customer email from signing in as a supplier), `login_otp`
(sign-in codes), `kyc` (`state` / `send_sms` / `verify_sms` / `accept_terms`),
`messages_api` (`threads` / `thread` / `send` / `request_chat`).

