"cost-of-ac-maintenance-uae": {
"slug": "cost-of-ac-maintenance-uae",
"title": "How much does AC repair & maintenance cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)",
"excerpt": "In the UAE, a routine AC service runs about AED 100–250 per split unit, an annual maintenance contract AED 300–800, and a gas refill AED 250–600. Bigger repairs like a compressor replacement reach AED 1,200–3,500. Exact pricing depends on the system and fault — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
"meta_desc": "UAE AC repair & maintenance costs: service AED 100–250/unit, annual contract AED 300–800, gas refill AED 250–600, compressor AED 1,200–3,500. Indicative 2026 ranges.",
"body_html": "<p>Air-conditioning is the single biggest service line most UAE homes and offices pay for &mdash; and the one where quotes vary the most. This 2026 guide gives you real price ranges so you can tell a fair quote from an inflated one before you commit.</p><p>All figures are indicative market ranges across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah and the Northern Emirates. Your actual price depends on the system, the fault and access &mdash; the quickest way to a firm number is to <a href=\"/app\">get free, comparable quotes</a>.</p><h2>Typical AC prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>One-time service, per split unit</td><td>120&ndash;300</td></tr><tr><td>Chemical / coil deep-clean, per unit</td><td>250&ndash;450</td></tr><tr><td>Annual maintenance contract &mdash; apartment (2&ndash;4 visits)</td><td>500&ndash;1,200</td></tr><tr><td>Annual maintenance contract &mdash; villa</td><td>1,200&ndash;3,000</td></tr><tr><td>Gas / refrigerant refill</td><td>250&ndash;600</td></tr><tr><td>Capacitor / fan-motor repair</td><td>150&ndash;700</td></tr><tr><td>Compressor replacement</td><td>1,200&ndash;3,500</td></tr><tr><td>Supply &amp; install new split AC (1&ndash;2 ton)</td><td>1,800&ndash;4,500</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; confirm scope, parts and warranty in writing before you accept a quote.</p><h2>Price by unit type</h2><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Per-visit service (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Split unit, 1.5 ton</td><td>120&ndash;220</td></tr><tr><td>Split unit, 2 ton</td><td>150&ndash;280</td></tr><tr><td>Ducted / concealed unit</td><td>300&ndash;600</td></tr><tr><td>Central / chiller (per system)</td><td>Quoted per site survey</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What a proper service includes</h2><ul><li>Filter cleaning and coil inspection</li><li>Gas pressure and temperature check</li><li>Drain-line clearing (a top cause of ceiling leaks)</li><li>At least one chemical coil clean per year</li><li>Thermostat and electrical safety check</li></ul><h2>What usually costs extra</h2><ul><li>Refrigerant top-up and any leak repair</li><li>Replacement parts (capacitor, motor, PCB, compressor)</li><li>Duct cleaning and grille sanitisation</li><li>Access equipment for high or rooftop units</li></ul><h2>What drives the price</h2><ul><li>Number and type of units (split, ducted or central)</li><li>Age and brand of the equipment</li><li>Severity of the fault and parts needed</li><li>One-off call-out vs an annual contract (AMC)</li><li>Height and accessibility of the units</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing AC quotes</h2><ul><li>A cheap &ldquo;service&rdquo; that is only a filter rinse &mdash; ask if a chemical coil clean is included</li><li>Repeated gas refills instead of finding and fixing the leak</li><li>No written parts warranty on repairs</li><li>Prices quoted before anyone has seen the system</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>How often should AC be serviced in the UAE?</b><div>Given the climate, most homes service every 3&ndash;6 months; an annual contract usually covers 2&ndash;4 visits with at least one chemical clean.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Why is a gas refill expensive?</b><div>It depends on the refrigerant type and amount. A recurring refill usually signals a leak that should be repaired rather than topped up again and again.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Is an annual AC contract worth it?</b><div>For two or more units it is usually cheaper than ad-hoc call-outs and includes scheduled cleaning that lowers bills and breakdowns.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What is a fair price to install a new split AC?</b><div>Supply and install of a 1&ndash;2 ton split typically runs AED 1,800&ndash;4,500 depending on brand, bracket work and pipe run &mdash; compare at least two quotes.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How often should AC be serviced in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Given the climate, most homes service every 3 to 6 months; an annual contract usually covers 2 to 4 visits with at least one chemical clean.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why is an AC gas refill expensive in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It depends on the refrigerant type and amount needed; a recurring refill usually signals a leak that should be repaired rather than re-filled.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is an annual AC maintenance contract worth it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For two or more units it is usually cheaper than ad-hoc call-outs and includes scheduled cleaning that lowers bills and breakdowns.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a fair price to install a new split AC in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Supply and install of a 1 to 2 ton split typically runs AED 1,800 to 4,500 depending on brand, bracket work and pipe run.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC repair &amp; maintenance suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-ac-duct-cleaning-uae/\">AC duct cleaning prices</a>.</p>",
"author": "QuotesDone",
"category": "Cost guides",
"published_at": "2026-06-28T20:51:06.189058+00:00",
"sort": 40
},
"cost-of-deep-cleaning-uae": {
"slug": "cost-of-deep-cleaning-uae",
"title": "How much does deep cleaning cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)",
"excerpt": "Deep cleaning in the UAE typically costs AED 250–400 for a studio, AED 350–600 for a 1-bedroom, AED 500–900 for a 2-bedroom and AED 900–1,800 for a villa. Hourly maid service runs about AED 30–45/hour. Price depends on size and condition — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
"meta_desc": "UAE deep cleaning costs: studio AED 250–400, 1BR AED 350–600, 2BR AED 500–900, villa AED 900–1,800, hourly maid AED 30–45. Indicative 2026 ranges.",
"body_html": "<p>Deep-cleaning prices in the UAE scale with the size and condition of your home, and with whether the company is licensed and insures its staff. This 2026 guide shows what to expect before you request quotes.</p><p>Ranges are indicative across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and the Northern Emirates. For a firm number, <a href=\"/app\">get free, comparable quotes</a>.</p><h2>Typical deep-cleaning prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Studio deep clean</td><td>300&ndash;450</td></tr><tr><td>1-bedroom deep clean</td><td>400&ndash;650</td></tr><tr><td>2-bedroom deep clean</td><td>600&ndash;900</td></tr><tr><td>3-bedroom / small villa</td><td>900&ndash;1,400</td></tr><tr><td>4&ndash;5 bedroom villa</td><td>1,400&ndash;2,200</td></tr><tr><td>Sofa / mattress shampoo</td><td>100&ndash;350</td></tr><tr><td>Post-construction cleaning (per sqft)</td><td>2&ndash;5</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; size, condition and add-ons change the number.</p><h2>Hourly maid service rates</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Per hour (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Licensed agency, trained staff</td><td>30&ndash;45</td></tr><tr><td>Specialist deep-clean crew</td><td>40&ndash;50</td></tr><tr><td>Freelance / informal</td><td>15&ndash;25</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Most agencies require a minimum booking of 2&ndash;3 hours. Freelance maids are cheaper but often uninsured &mdash; you carry the risk.</p><h2>What is usually included</h2><ul><li>Detailed kitchen and bathroom scrubbing (grout, tiles, fittings)</li><li>Interior windows, doors and reachable surfaces</li><li>Floors washed and sanitised</li><li>Skirting, switches and handle wipe-down</li></ul><h2>What usually costs extra</h2><ul><li>Sofa, mattress and carpet shampoo</li><li>Exterior windows and AC vents</li><li>Fridge / oven interior and cabinet interiors</li><li>Steam cleaning and pest add-ons</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing cleaning quotes</h2><ul><li>No cleaning-services licence or staff insurance</li><li>A vague &ldquo;deep clean&rdquo; with no written list of inclusions</li><li>A per-hour rate that turns out to need far more hours than quoted</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What is included in a deep clean?</b><div>Detailed cleaning of kitchen, bathrooms, floors, doors and reachable surfaces &mdash; more thorough than a regular visit. Always confirm inclusions in the quote.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Deep clean vs regular cleaning?</b><div>Regular cleaning maintains; deep cleaning is a periodic intensive reset, ideal for move-in/out or post-renovation.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Are cleaning companies in the UAE licensed?</b><div>Reputable ones hold a cleaning-services licence and insure their staff. On QuotesDone, suppliers are vetted.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How many cleaners and hours for a deep clean?</b><div>A 2-bedroom usually takes two cleaners 4&ndash;6 hours; a villa needs a larger crew or a full day.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is included in a deep clean in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Detailed cleaning of kitchen, bathrooms, floors, doors and reachable surfaces, more thorough than a regular visit. Always confirm inclusions in the quote.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between deep cleaning and regular cleaning?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Regular cleaning maintains the home; deep cleaning is a periodic intensive reset, ideal for move-in/out or post-renovation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are cleaning companies in the UAE licensed?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Reputable ones hold a cleaning-services licence and insure their staff. On QuotesDone, suppliers are vetted.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many cleaners and hours does a deep clean take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A 2-bedroom usually takes two cleaners 4 to 6 hours; a villa needs a larger crew or a full day.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">cleaning services suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-ac-duct-cleaning-uae/\">AC duct cleaning</a> &middot; <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-pest-control-uae/\">pest control prices</a>.</p>",
