"cost-of-house-painting-uae": {
"slug": "cost-of-house-painting-uae",
"title": "How much does house painting cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)",
"excerpt": "Painting in the UAE typically costs AED 8–20 per square metre (labour + standard paint). A 1-bedroom apartment runs about AED 800–1,800, a 2-bedroom AED 1,500–3,000 and a 3–4 bedroom villa AED 4,000–12,000. Premium paints and heavy prep cost more — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
"meta_desc": "UAE painting costs: AED 8–20/sqm, 1BR AED 800–1,800, 2BR AED 1,500–3,000, villa AED 4,000–12,000. Indicative 2026 ranges.",
"body_html": "<p>Most UAE painting quotes are priced either per square metre or as a flat per-home rate. Because &ldquo;paint the apartment&rdquo; can mean very different amounts of prep, coats and paint grade, two quotes for the same flat can differ by thousands. This 2026 guide shows what is reasonable.</p><p>Ranges below are indicative across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and the Northern Emirates. Get <a href=\"/app\">free, comparable quotes</a> to see a firm number for your home.</p><h2>Typical painting prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Job</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Per square metre &mdash; standard emulsion (labour + paint)</td><td>10&ndash;20</td></tr><tr><td>Per square metre &mdash; premium / washable paint</td><td>18&ndash;30</td></tr><tr><td>Studio apartment</td><td>900&ndash;1,800</td></tr><tr><td>1-bedroom apartment</td><td>1,200&ndash;2,500</td></tr><tr><td>2-bedroom apartment</td><td>2,000&ndash;4,500</td></tr><tr><td>3-bedroom apartment</td><td>3,500&ndash;6,500</td></tr><tr><td>Villa (3&ndash;4 bed), interior only</td><td>6,000&ndash;15,000</td></tr><tr><td>Villa, interior + exterior</td><td>15,000&ndash;25,000+</td></tr><tr><td>Feature / accent wall</td><td>150&ndash;500</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; area, paint grade and prep change the number. Confirm coats and paint brand in writing.</p><h2>What is usually included</h2><ul><li>Minor crack filling, sanding and one coat of primer</li><li>Two coats of standard emulsion in neutral colours</li><li>Basic protection of floors and fittings</li><li>Clean-up and waste removal</li></ul><h2>What usually costs extra</h2><ul><li>Premium, washable, anti-fungal or textured paints</li><li>Heavy crack repair, damp treatment or skimming</li><li>Extra colours, dark shades or feature finishes</li><li>Moving and reinstating heavy furniture</li></ul><h2>What drives the price</h2><ul><li>Wall area and ceiling height</li><li>Paint grade (standard vs premium/washable)</li><li>Amount of prep: filling, sanding, priming</li><li>Number of coats and colours</li><li>Exterior work needing scaffolding or a cradle</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing painting quotes</h2><ul><li>A price with no mention of primer or number of coats</li><li>&ldquo;Labour only&rdquo; hidden until after you accept &mdash; confirm supply + apply</li><li>No line for surface prep on a wall with visible cracks or damp</li><li>A quote far below the rest &mdash; usually one thin coat of cheap paint</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>Does the price include paint?</b><div>Usually yes for standard emulsion; premium or specialty paints cost extra. Confirm whether the quote is &ldquo;supply + apply&rdquo; or labour only.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does painting an apartment take?</b><div>A 1&ndash;2 bedroom is typically 1&ndash;3 days depending on prep and drying time.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How many coats should I expect?</b><div>Two coats over primer is standard. One coat is a common way cheap quotes cut corners &mdash; it rarely covers evenly.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Do I need to move out during painting?</b><div>No &mdash; most jobs are done room by room; just clear or cover furniture.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does a UAE painting quote include the paint?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Usually yes for standard emulsion; premium or specialty paints cost extra. Confirm whether it is supply plus apply, or labour only.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does it take to paint an apartment in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A 1 to 2 bedroom apartment is typically 1 to 3 days depending on prep and drying time.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many coats of paint should I expect?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Two coats over primer is standard. One coat is a common way cheap quotes cut corners and it rarely covers evenly.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need to move out during painting?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No, most jobs are done room by room; just clear or cover furniture.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/painting/\">painting &amp; decorating suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-fit-out-uae/\">fit-out costs</a> &middot; <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-flooring-uae/\">flooring prices</a>.</p>",
