"title": "How much does flooring cost per square metre in the UAE? (2026 price guide)",
"excerpt": "Flooring in the UAE typically costs AED 40–120 per square metre for ceramic/porcelain tiles (supply + fix), AED 45–110 for SPC/vinyl, AED 60–150 for parquet/laminate and AED 120–400 for marble. Epoxy runs AED 60–180. Price depends on material and subfloor — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
"meta_desc": "UAE flooring costs per sqm: tiles AED 40–120, SPC/vinyl AED 45–110, parquet AED 60–150, marble AED 120–400, epoxy AED 60–180. Indicative 2026 ranges.",
"body_html": "<p>Flooring is priced per square metre, supply-plus-fix or labour-only &mdash; and the material choice is most of the number. This 2026 guide shows fair ranges.</p><p>Ranges are indicative across the Emirates. For a firm number, <a href=\"/app\">get free, comparable quotes</a>.</p><h2>Typical flooring prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Material</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ceramic / porcelain tiles (supply + fix, per sqm)</td><td>40&ndash;120</td></tr><tr><td>SPC / vinyl (per sqm)</td><td>45&ndash;110</td></tr><tr><td>Parquet / laminate (per sqm)</td><td>60&ndash;150</td></tr><tr><td>Marble (supply + fix, per sqm)</td><td>120&ndash;400</td></tr><tr><td>Epoxy flooring (per sqm)</td><td>60&ndash;180</td></tr><tr><td>Tile fixing, labour only (per sqm)</td><td>25&ndash;60</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; material, subfloor and pattern change the number.</p><h2>What drives the price</h2><ul><li>Material and grade</li><li>Supply + fix vs labour only</li><li>Subfloor prep and screed</li><li>Laying pattern (straight, diagonal, herringbone)</li><li>Skirting and thresholds</li></ul><h2>Included vs extra</h2><ul><li><b>Usually included:</b> fixing, adhesive/grout, basic leveling.</li><li><b>Usually extra:</b> screed/self-leveling, removing the old floor, skirting, sealing/polishing.</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing quotes</h2><ul><li>Labour-only quoted to look like supply + fix</li><li>No subfloor prep on an uneven floor</li><li>Cheap adhesive that fails under UAE heat</li><li>Wastage for cuts not accounted for</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>Tiles, vinyl or parquet?</b><div>Tiles are durable and cool underfoot, vinyl is warm and cheaper, parquet gives a premium feel but needs care.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Is removing the old floor included?</b><div>Usually it is an extra line &mdash; confirm it.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How much extra material should I buy?</b><div>Around 10% extra for cuts and future repairs.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Tiles, vinyl or parquet in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Tiles are durable and cool underfoot, vinyl is warm and cheaper, parquet gives a premium feel but needs care.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is removing the old floor included in a flooring quote?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Usually it is an extra line, confirm it.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much extra flooring material should I buy?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Around 10% extra for cuts and future repairs.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/flooring/\">flooring suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-tiling-marble-uae/\">tiling &amp; marble costs</a> &middot; <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-fit-out-uae/\">fit-out costs</a>.</p>",
