"excerpt": "A new kitchen in the UAE typically costs AED 8,000–18,000 for a budget laminate kitchen, AED 18,000–45,000 for a mid-range acrylic/MDF kitchen and AED 50,000–150,000+ for premium or imported units. Per linear metre it is roughly AED 1,500–6,000. Price depends on size and materials — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
