"title": "How much does electrical work cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)",
"excerpt": "In the UAE, an electrician call-out is about AED 100–250, replacing a DB/distribution board AED 800–2,500, and per wiring point AED 60–180. A full villa rewire runs AED 8,000–35,000. Price depends on scope and access — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
"meta_desc": "UAE electrical costs: call-out AED 100–250, DB board AED 800–2,500, per point AED 60–180, villa rewire AED 8,000–35,000. Indicative 2026 ranges.",
"body_html": "<p>Electrical work is priced by call-out, by point, or by project &mdash; and the safety and certification of the work matter more than the headline price. This 2026 guide shows fair ranges.</p><p>Ranges are indicative across the Emirates. For a firm number, <a href=\"/app\">get free, comparable quotes</a>.</p><h2>Typical electrical prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Job</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Electrician call-out</td><td>100&ndash;250</td></tr><tr><td>Per wiring point (supply + install)</td><td>60&ndash;180</td></tr><tr><td>Distribution board (DB) replacement</td><td>800&ndash;2,500</td></tr><tr><td>Light fitting / fixture install (each)</td><td>50&ndash;200</td></tr><tr><td>Full villa rewire</td><td>8,000&ndash;35,000</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; scope, cable runs and access change the number.</p><h2>What drives the price</h2><ul><li>Number of points and circuits</li><li>DB size and brand</li><li>Wall chasing vs surface conduit</li><li>Villa vs apartment</li><li>Authority compliance and testing</li></ul><h2>Included vs extra</h2><ul><li><b>Usually included:</b> labour, standard accessories, basic testing.</li><li><b>Usually extra:</b> premium switches/sockets, wall chasing and making good, authority approvals.</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing quotes</h2><ul><li>No mention of testing or certification</li><li>Under-rated cable used to cut cost</li><li>Adding load to an old DB with no capacity check</li><li>Cash job with no invoice or warranty</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>Do I need a licensed electrician?</b><div>Yes &mdash; use a licensed contractor, especially for DB work and rewiring. It protects safety and insurance.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Signs I need a rewire?</b><div>Frequent trips, warm sockets, flickering, or old/cloth wiring are common signs.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Is making-good included?</b><div>Often not &mdash; plastering and painting after chasing walls is usually a separate line.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need a licensed electrician in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, use a licensed contractor, especially for DB work and rewiring. It protects safety and insurance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the signs I need a rewire?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Frequent trips, warm sockets, flickering, or old or cloth wiring are common signs.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is making-good included in an electrical quote?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Often not, plastering and painting after chasing walls is usually a separate line.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/electrical/\">electrical suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-smart-home-uae/\">smart-home costs</a> &middot; <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-cctv-installation-uae/\">CCTV prices</a>.</p>",
