"title": "How much does a fit-out cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)",
"excerpt": "In the UAE, an apartment fit-out typically costs AED 60–250 per sqft, an office fit-out AED 80–300 per sqft, and a retail fit-out AED 150–400 per sqft. A villa renovation commonly runs AED 150,000–800,000+ depending on scope. Price depends on finish level — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
