pare fit-out quotes fairly?</b><div>Compare the BOQ line by line, not just the total &mdash; scopes vary hugely.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a turnkey fit-out?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"One contractor handles everything from design through to handover.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need approvals for a fit-out in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Offices, retail and F&B usually need Dubai Municipality and sometimes Civil Defence approvals.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I compare fit-out quotes fairly?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Compare the bill of quantities line by line, not just the total, scopes vary hugely.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">fit-out &amp; interior suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-kitchen-uae/\">kitchen costs</a> &middot; <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-flooring-uae/\">flooring prices</a> &middot; <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-false-ceiling-uae/\">false-ceiling costs</a>.</p>",
