"title": "How much does waterproofing cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)",
"excerpt": "In the UAE, roof/terrace waterproofing typically costs AED 25–70 per sqm, bathroom waterproofing AED 400–1,200 per bathroom, and water-tank waterproofing AED 800–3,000. Price depends on area, system and prep — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
"meta_desc": "UAE waterproofing costs: roof AED 25–70/sqm, bathroom AED 400–1,200, water tank AED 800–3,000. Indicative 2026 ranges.",
"body_html": "<p>Waterproofing is priced per square metre for roofs and terraces, or per bathroom or tank &mdash; and skipping proper prep is the top reason it fails early. This 2026 guide shows fair ranges.</p><p>Ranges are indicative across the Emirates. For a firm number, <a href=\"/app\">get free, comparable quotes</a>.</p><h2>Typical waterproofing prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Roof / terrace (per sqm)</td><td>25&ndash;70</td></tr><tr><td>Bathroom (per bathroom)</td><td>400&ndash;1,200</td></tr><tr><td>Balcony</td><td>500&ndash;2,000</td></tr><tr><td>Water tank</td><td>800&ndash;3,000</td></tr><tr><td>Basement / retaining wall (per sqm)</td><td>40&ndash;100</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; area, system and prep change the number.</p><h2>What drives the price</h2><ul><li>Area and location (roof, wet area, tank, basement)</li><li>Membrane system (liquid, torch-on, cementitious)</li><li>Surface prep and crack repair</li><li>Number of coats</li><li>Warranty length</li></ul><h2>Included vs extra</h2><ul><li><b>Usually included:</b> surface prep, membrane application, basic testing.</li><li><b>Usually extra:</b> screed and tile reinstatement, major crack/structural repair, extended warranty.</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing quotes</h2><ul><li>No surface prep on a cracked or dusty slab</li><li>A single thin coat where the system needs two</li><li>No water / ponding test after application</li><li>No written warranty</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does waterproofing last?</b><div>A good system with a warranty lasts many years; poor prep can fail within months.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Is tiling reinstatement included?</b><div>Usually extra &mdash; removing and re-laying tiles is a separate line.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Best system for bathrooms?</b><div>A proper wet-area membrane applied before tiling &mdash; not just grout sealer.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does waterproofing last in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A good system with a warranty lasts many years; poor prep can fail within months.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is tiling reinstatement included in waterproofing?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Usually extra, removing and re-laying tiles is a separate line.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Best waterproofing system for bathrooms?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A proper wet-area membrane applied before tiling, not just grout sealer.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">waterproofing suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-plumbing-uae/\">plumbing costs</a> &middot; <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-tiling-marble-uae/\">tiling &amp; marble prices</a>.</p>",
