"body_html": "<p>Dust, sand and humidity mean UAE air ducts clog faster than in most climates &mdash; and dirty ducts push up AC bills and worsen allergies. This 2026 guide shows fair prices before you book.</p><p>Ranges are indicative across the Emirates. For a firm number, <a href=\"/app\">get free, comparable quotes</a>.</p><h2>Typical AC duct-cleaning prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Apartment duct cleaning</td><td>400&ndash;1,200</td></tr><tr><td>Villa duct cleaning</td><td>800&ndash;2,500</td></tr><tr><td>Per air outlet / grille</td><td>40&ndash;120</td></tr><tr><td>Anti-bacterial fogging / sanitisation</td><td>150&ndash;500</td></tr><tr><td>Combined duct + AC service package</td><td>800&ndash;3,000</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; duct length, outlet count and access change the number.</p><h2>What drives the price</h2><ul><li>Number of air outlets and total duct length</li><li>Apartment vs villa (and number of AC systems)</li><li>Sanitisation / fogging add-ons</li><li>Access above false ceilings</li><li>Whether AHU/FCU cleaning is included</li></ul><h2>Included vs extra</h2><ul><li><b>Usually included:</b> grille removal, vacuum/brush of reachable ducts, refit.</li><li><b>Usually extra:</b> anti-bacterial fogging, coil and drain-pan cleaning, mould treatment.</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing quotes</h2><ul><li>A &ldquo;duct clean&rdquo; that is only wiping the visible grilles</li><li>No before/after photos of the ducts</li><li>Sanitisation quoted as standard, then added on the day</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>How often should ducts be cleaned in the UAE?</b><div>Every 1&ndash;2 years for most homes, sooner after construction or if anyone has allergies.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Does duct cleaning lower AC bills?</b><div>Yes &mdash; cleaner ducts and coils let the system run more efficiently.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Is it the same as an AC service?</b><div>No &mdash; duct cleaning is separate from servicing the AC unit itself; many buy them together.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How often should AC ducts be cleaned in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Every 1 to 2 years for most homes, sooner after construction or if anyone has allergies.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does duct cleaning lower AC bills?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, cleaner ducts and coils let the system run more efficiently.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is duct cleaning the same as an AC service?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No, duct cleaning is separate from servicing the AC unit itself; many buy them together.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/ac-duct-cleaning/\">AC duct-cleaning suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-ac-maintenance-uae/\">AC maintenance prices</a> &middot; <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-deep-cleaning-uae/\">deep cleaning costs</a>.</p>",
