"body_html": "<p>Aluminium and glass works are priced by the square metre and by glass type &mdash; and the gap between ordinary glass and tempered safety glass is where quotes diverge. This 2026 guide shows fair ranges.</p><p>Ranges are indicative across the Emirates. For a firm number, <a href=\"/app\">get free, comparable quotes</a>.</p><h2>Typical aluminium &amp; glass prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Glass partition (per sqm)</td><td>250&ndash;700</td></tr><tr><td>Shower enclosure</td><td>800&ndash;3,500</td></tr><tr><td>Aluminium window (per sqm)</td><td>250&ndash;800</td></tr><tr><td>Aluminium &amp; glass door</td><td>900&ndash;4,000</td></tr><tr><td>Glass railing / balustrade (per metre)</td><td>350&ndash;1,200</td></tr><tr><td>Glass / aluminium pergola (per sqm)</td><td>350&ndash;900</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; glass thickness, framing and hardware change the number.</p><h2>What drives the price</h2><ul><li>Glass type and thickness (clear, tinted, tempered, laminated)</li><li>Frame system and finish (powder-coat colour)</li><li>Size and number of openings</li><li>Hardware, locks and hinges</li><li>Height and access for installation</li></ul><h2>Included vs extra</h2><ul><li><b>Usually included:</b> fabrication, standard hardware, installation.</li><li><b>Usually extra:</b> tempered/laminated upgrades, special colours, mosquito nets, repeat site visits.</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing quotes</h2><ul><li>Ordinary glass offered where tempered/safety glass is required (showers, doors, railings)</li><li>Glass thickness not stated on the quote</li><li>No warranty on seals, rollers or hardware</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>Tempered vs normal glass?</b><div>Tempered is safety glass &mdash; required for showers, doors and railings. It costs more but is far safer.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Do they measure on site first?</b><div>Reputable firms do a site survey before giving a final price and fabricating.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does it take?</b><div>Fabrication is typically 1&ndash;2 weeks after measurement, then install.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Tempered vs normal glass in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Tempered is safety glass, required for showers, doors and railings. It costs more but is far safer.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do aluminium and glass firms measure on site first?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Reputable firms do a site survey before giving a final price and fabricating.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does aluminium and glass work take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Fabrication is typically 1 to 2 weeks after measurement, then install.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/aluminium-glass/\">aluminium &amp; glass suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-fit-out-uae/\">fit-out costs</a>.</p>",
