"title": "How much does signage cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)",
"excerpt": "In the UAE, 3D acrylic letters typically cost AED 150–800 per letter, a light box about AED 80–250 per sqft, and vinyl/sticker work AED 15–60 per sqft. Large pylon signage runs AED 5,000–50,000+. Price depends on type, size and lighting — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
"meta_desc": "UAE signage costs: 3D letters AED 150–800/letter, light box AED 80–250/sqft, vinyl AED 15–60/sqft, pylon AED 5k–50k+. Indicative 2026 ranges.",
"body_html": "<p>Signage is priced by type, size and lighting &mdash; 3D letters, light boxes, vinyl and large pylons are very different jobs. This 2026 guide shows fair ranges. Note that shopfront and outdoor signage in the UAE usually needs municipality approval.</p><p>Ranges are indicative across the Emirates. For a firm number, <a href=\"/app\">get free, comparable quotes</a>.</p><h2>Typical signage prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3D acrylic letters (per letter)</td><td>150&ndash;800</td></tr><tr><td>Illuminated light box (per sqft)</td><td>80&ndash;250</td></tr><tr><td>Vinyl / sticker work (per sqft)</td><td>15&ndash;60</td></tr><tr><td>Acrylic sign board</td><td>300&ndash;2,000</td></tr><tr><td>Neon / LED flex sign</td><td>500&ndash;3,000</td></tr><tr><td>Pylon / totem signage</td><td>5,000&ndash;50,000+</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; type, size and lighting change the number.</p><h2>What drives the price</h2><ul><li>Sign type and size</li><li>Illuminated vs non-lit</li><li>Materials (acrylic, stainless steel, LED)</li><li>Installation height and access</li><li>Municipality approval and permits</li></ul><h2>Included vs extra</h2><ul><li><b>Usually included:</b> fabrication and standard installation.</li><li><b>Usually extra:</b> approvals/permits, crane or cherry-picker access, electrical connection, night-time install.</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing quotes</h2><ul><li>Approval/permit not mentioned for a shopfront sign</li><li>No warranty on the LEDs</li><li>A &ldquo;per letter&rdquo; price that excludes backing and install</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>Do I need approval for a shop sign?</b><div>Yes &mdash; most emirates require municipality approval for shopfront and outdoor signage.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Lit vs non-lit signage?</b><div>Illuminated signs cost more but are visible at night &mdash; usually worth it for retail.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What is the lead time?</b><div>Typically 1&ndash;2 weeks for fabrication, plus approval time.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need approval for a shop sign in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, most emirates require municipality approval for shopfront and outdoor signage.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Lit vs non-lit signage?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Illuminated signs cost more but are visible at night, usually worth it for retail.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the lead time for signage?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Typically 1 to 2 weeks for fabrication, plus approval time.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/signage/\">signage suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-fit-out-uae/\">fit-out costs</a>.</p>",
