"title": "How much does facilities management cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)",
"excerpt": "In the UAE, facilities management is typically priced per square foot per year — roughly AED 8–25/sqft for soft + hard FM, depending on services. AMC packages for MEP and common areas vary by building. Price depends on scope and building size — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.",
"meta_desc": "UAE facilities management costs: roughly AED 8–25/sqft/year for soft + hard FM; MEP AMC varies. Indicative 2026 ranges.",
"body_html": "<p>Facilities management (FM) is usually priced per square foot per year, split into &ldquo;soft&rdquo; services (cleaning, security, landscaping) and &ldquo;hard&rdquo; services (MEP, HVAC, lifts). This 2026 guide frames what is fair.</p><p>Ranges are indicative across the Emirates. For a firm number, <a href=\"/app\">get free, comparable quotes</a>.</p><h2>Typical FM prices in the UAE (2026)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Scope</th><th>Indicative price (AED)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Soft FM (per sqft / year)</td><td>3&ndash;10</td></tr><tr><td>Hard FM / MEP (per sqft / year)</td><td>5&ndash;15</td></tr><tr><td>Total FM, soft + hard (per sqft / year)</td><td>8&ndash;25</td></tr><tr><td>MEP AMC, small building</td><td>15,000&ndash;60,000</td></tr><tr><td>Common-area cleaning (per month)</td><td>Quoted per site</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:#9DB2B2;font-size:13px\">Indicative ranges only &mdash; scope, building size and service levels change the number.</p><h2>What drives the price</h2><ul><li>Building size and asset list</li><li>Soft vs hard vs total FM</li><li>Response SLAs and manned hours</li><li>Age and condition of MEP systems</li><li>Whether spare parts are included</li></ul><h2>Included vs extra</h2><ul><li><b>Usually included:</b> scheduled PPM, defined manpower, reactive work within SLA.</li><li><b>Usually extra:</b> major spares, capital replacements, out-of-scope call-outs.</li></ul><h2>Red flags when comparing quotes</h2><ul><li>A low per-sqft rate hiding a thin scope</li><li>No PPM schedule attached to the quote</li><li>Unclear who pays for spare parts</li><li>No SLA response times stated</li></ul><h2>FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>Soft vs hard FM?</b><div>Soft = cleaning, security, landscaping. Hard = MEP, HVAC, lifts and building systems.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What is PPM?</b><div>Planned preventive maintenance &mdash; scheduled servicing to prevent breakdowns.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How do I compare FM quotes fairly?</b><div>Compare the scope and SLAs, not just the per-sqft rate &mdash; cheap often means less.</div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between soft and hard FM?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Soft is cleaning, security and landscaping. Hard is MEP, HVAC, lifts and building systems.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is PPM in facilities management?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Planned preventive maintenance, scheduled servicing to prevent breakdowns.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I compare FM quotes fairly?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Compare the scope and SLAs, not just the per-sqft rate, cheap often means less.\"}}]}</script><p style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Compare <a href=\"/services/facilities-management/\">facilities-management suppliers across the UAE</a> anonymously on QuotesDone. Related: <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-ac-maintenance-uae/\">AC maintenance prices</a>.</p>",
