not liable for indirect or consequential loss, or for the acts, omissions or works of any Supplier.</p><p>Nothing in these Terms limits or excludes liability for fraud, gross negligence, death or personal injury caused by negligence, or any liability that cannot be limited or excluded under UAE law, including non-waivable consumer rights.</p><h2>10. Data protection</h2><p>QuotesDone Technologies (E-Trader Licence No. 1633275), the operator of the Platform, is the data controller. We process personal data in accordance with the UAE Personal Data Protection Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021), on the lawful bases of performance of a contract, our legitimate business interests, and your consent where required, and we may use service providers (including outside the UAE) under appropriate safeguards. You may exercise your rights of access, correction, deletion and objection, and raise complaints, as set out in our Privacy Policy.</p><p>Electronic communications: we send transactional messages (one-time passwords, request and quote notifications, and account or payment confirmations) as part of providing the service; these are not marketing. We send marketing or promotional messages by email or SMS only with your consent, and you may opt out at any time. Electronic communications are handled in line with the rules of the Telecommunications and Digital Government Regulatory Authority (TDRA) and the Electronic Transactions and Trust Services Law, Federal Decree-Law No. 46 of 2021.</p><h2>11. Consumer rights</h2><p>Where the Consumer Protection Law (Federal Law No. 15 of 2020) and Cabinet Resolution No. 66 of 2023 apply, your statutory rights are preserved and prevail over any inconsistent provision of these Terms.</p><h2>12. Suspension and termination</h2><p>QuotesDone may suspend or terminate access for breach of these Terms, suspected fraud or circumvention, or as required by law. You may stop using the Platform at any time; fees already incurred remain payable.</p><h2>13. Changes to these Terms</h2><p>QuotesDone may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be notified through the Platform or by email and take effect prospectively.</p><h2>14. AI-generated content and platform outputs</h2><p>QuotesDone uses automated and AI-based tools to interpret your requirements, generate bills of quantities and cost estimates, standardise and compare quotations, and power support assistants. These outputs are provided for convenience only, may contain errors, and are not professional, engineering, legal or financial advice. You must verify any such output before relying on it, and QuotesDone is not liable for loss arising from reliance on automated outputs. QuotesDone does not guarantee that you will receive any quotation, or any particular number, price or quality of quotations.</p><h2>15. Payments, the payment processor, no escrow, and chargebacks</h2><p>The Reveal Fee is charged through a third-party payment processor; QuotesDone does not store your full card details and is not liable for processor outages or errors. All amounts are in UAE Dirhams (AED) unless stated otherwise. Because a Reveal delivers value (the supplier&#39;s identity and contact details) immediately, the Reveal Fee is non-refundable except as set out in section 5 (Refunds and non-responsive suppliers). Initiating a chargeback or payment dispute after a Reveal, other than for a genuine unauthorised transaction, is a breach of these Terms and entitles QuotesDone to suspend your account and recover the disputed amount and reasonable costs.</p><p><b>No escrow; QuotesDone does not hold your money.</b> The only payment QuotesDone collects is its own Reveal Fee, charged through the third-party payment processor at the moment of Reveal. QuotesDone does not hold, escrow, receive, transmit or process any payment for the goods, works or services quoted between you and a Supplier. All payment for the actual job is arranged and settled directly between you and the Supplier, on terms agreed between you. QuotesDone is not a party to that contract and does not act as an escrow agent, payment institution, money-services business or stored-value provider in respect of those funds, and accepts no responsibility for the payment, non-payment, performance or quality of any job.</p><h2>16. Electronic acceptance and records</h2><p>Ticking the acceptance box or continuing to use the Platform constitutes a valid and binding electronic acceptance of these Terms under the laws of the United Arab Emirates. QuotesDone&#39;s records, including its acceptance logs and the signed acceptance certificate it generates, are admissible and, absent manifest error, conclusive evidence of the terms you accepted and when.</p><h2>17. Compliance and communications</h2><p>You warrant that you are not subject to sanctions and that your funds are lawful, and you will comply with applicable anti-money-laundering and sanctions laws. You consent to receive service and transactional communications, and (unless you opt out) promotional communications, by email, SMS and WhatsApp, and may unsubscribe from promotional messages at any time. Any feedback or suggestions you provide may be used by QuotesDone freely and without obligation.</p><h2>18. Complaints and dispute resolution</h2><p>If you have a complaint, please contact QuotesDone first at management@quotesdone.com or through the Platform. We will acknowledge your complaint within two (2) working days and aim to resolve it within a reasonable period. If your complaint is not resolved to your satisfaction, you may escalate it to the Consumer Protection Department of the UAE Ministry of Economy and Tourism (call centre 800-1222) or another competent authority. This complaints procedure does not affect your statutory rights or the governing law and jurisdiction set out below.</p><h2>19. Governing law and jurisdiction</h2><p>This document is governed by the laws of the United Arab Emirates, including the Commercial Transactions Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 50 of 2022), the Personal Data Protection Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021), the Electronic Transactions and Trust Services Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 46 of 2021), the Consumer Protection Law (Federal Law No. 15 of 2020) and its Implementing Regulation (Cabinet Resolution No. 66 of 2023), and the Civil Transactions Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 25 of 2025, in force from 1 June 2026, replacing Federal Law No. 5 of 1985). The courts of Dubai have jurisdiction.</p><h2>20. Contact</h2><p>This Platform is operated by QuotesDone Technologies, E-Trader (Professional) Licence No. 1633275, Commercial Register No. 2883503, Dubai, UAE. Questions about these Terms can be sent to info@quotesdone.com or management@quotesdone.com.</p><h2>Permitted use &amp; platform protection</h2><p>These provisions form part of the Customer Terms (Version 3, effective 3 July 2026) and are accepted at registration.</p><p>By registering and using QuotesDone, you agree that you will not: (a) access or use the Platform to build, design, benchmark or assist any competing product or service; (b) copy, scrape, harvest, republish or extract any supplier data, pricing, content or other materials from the Platform by any automated or manual means; or (c) reverse-engineer, decompile or replicate any part of the Platform&#39;s software, matching logic, anonymisation outputs or document templates. All such data and materials remain the exclusive property of QuotesDone.</p><p>Any breach of this clause entitles QuotesDone to immediate suspension or termination of the account, liquidated compensation of AED 10,000 per incident as a genuine pre-estimate of loss, recovery of any further proven losses, and injunctive relief to stop ongoing breach.</p></div><script>/*qdarfix*/(function(){if((localStorage.getItem('qd_lang')||'en')!=='ar')return;function run(){var c=document.querySelector('.crumb');if(c)c.innerHTML='<a href=\"/\">الرئيسية</a> › القانوني › شروط الخدمة'