"title": "QuotesDone Blog — UAE sourcing & procurement guides",
"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · Blog</div><h1>QuotesDone blog</h1><p class=\"lead\">Practical guides for buying building, fit-out and home services in the UAE — real price ranges, checklists and the right questions to ask suppliers before you sign.</p></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><div class=\"blist\"><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/compare-contractor-quotes-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Buyer guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g92866\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0B8276\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#0C2330\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g92866)\"/><circle cx=\"506\" cy=\"-54\" r=\"79\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"494\" cy=\"233\" r=\"88\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><rect x=\"12\" y=\"8\" width=\"24\" height=\"32\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M17 18 H31 M17 24 H31 M17 30 H26\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Buyer guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Buyer guides</span><h2>How to compare contractor quotes in the UAE without getting burned</h2><p>Three quotes that look similar can hide very different scopes. Here is how UAE buyers read past the bottom line.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/fit-out-quote-dubai-checklist/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Buyer guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g7545\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#116E67\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g7545)\"/><circle cx=\"305\" cy=\"31\" r=\"32\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"348\" cy=\"157\" r=\"29\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M8 24 L24 10 L40 24 M12 21 V40 H36 V21\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Buyer guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Buyer guides</span><h2>What a fair office fit-out quote in Dubai should include</h2><p>A proper fit-out quote is more than flooring and paint. Use this checklist before you sign anything.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/fire-fighting-systems-uae-civil-defence/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Trade guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g42430\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0D9488\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#08222A\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g42430)\"/><circle cx=\"470\" cy=\"41\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"305\" cy=\"226\" r=\"61\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M25 6 c5 8 10 10 10 18 a11 11 0 0 1-22 0 c0-5 3-8 5-11 1 3 3 4 5 4 -2-6 -1-8 2-11z\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Trade guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Trade guides</span><h2>Fire-fighting systems in the UAE: approvals, standards and what to ask suppliers</h2><p>Civil Defence approval, NFPA standards and UL/FM listings decide whether your fire system passes. Here is what to specify.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-ac-maintenance-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g72503\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#116E67\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g72503)\"/><circle cx=\"143\" cy=\"162\" r=\"185\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"588\" cy=\"337\" r=\"134\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M24 6 V42 M6 24 H42 M11 11 L37 37 M37 11 L11 37\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does AC repair &amp; maintenance cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, a routine AC service runs about AED 100–250 per split unit, an annual maintenance contract AED 300–800, and a gas refill AED 250–600. Bigger repairs like a compressor replacement reach AED 1,200–3,500. Exact pricing depends on the system and fault — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-deep-cleaning-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g34733\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#116E67\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g34733)\"/><circle cx=\"213\" cy=\"91\" r=\"190\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"642\" cy=\"370\" r=\"117\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M24 8 l3.2 9.6 9.6 3.2 -9.6 3.2 -3.2 9.6 -3.2-9.6 -9.6-3.2 9.6-3.2z\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke=\"none\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does deep cleaning cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>Deep cleaning in the UAE typically costs AED 250–400 for a studio, AED 350–600 for a 1-bedroom, AED 500–900 for a 2-bedroom and AED 900–1,800 for a villa. Hourly maid service runs about AED 30–45/hour. Price depends on size and condition — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-house-painting-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g48642\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0B8276\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#0C2330\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g48642)\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"80\" r=\"135\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"568\" cy=\"332\" r=\"113\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M10 40 c1-6 3-9 8-9 M18 31 L34 15 l4 4 -16 16 z M31 12 l5 5\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does house painting cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>Painting in the UAE typically costs AED 8–20 per square metre (labour + standard paint). A 1-bedroom apartment runs about AED 800–1,800, a 2-bedroom AED 1,500–3,000 and a 3–4 bedroom villa AED 4,000–12,000. Premium paints and heavy prep cost more — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-flooring-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g80571\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#15807A\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g80571)\"/><circle cx=\"451\" cy=\"171\" r=\"157\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"649\" cy=\"272\" r=\"133\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M8 8 H40 V40 H8 Z M24 8 V40 M8 24 H40\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does flooring cost per square metre in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>Flooring in the UAE typically costs AED 40–120 per square metre for ceramic/porcelain tiles (supply + fix), AED 45–110 for SPC/vinyl, AED 60–150 for parquet/laminate and AED 120–400 for marble. Epoxy runs AED 60–180. Price depends on material and subfloor — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-cctv-installation-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g11820\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0F766E\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g11820)\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"-35\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"471\" cy=\"127\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"17\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M29 21 L41 16 V32 L29 27 Z\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does CCTV installation cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>A CCTV installation in the UAE typically costs AED 350–900 per camera (supply + install). A 4-camera HD package runs about AED 1,500–3,500 and an 8-camera setup AED 2,800–6,500, including the recorder. 4K/IP systems cost more. In Dubai many premises must use SIRA-approved equipment — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-kitchen-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g24431\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#116E67\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g24431)\"/><circle cx=\"311\" cy=\"-59\" r=\"55\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"511\" cy=\"167\" r=\"34\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M8 24 L24 10 L40 24 M12 21 V40 H36 V21\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does a new kitchen cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>A new kitchen in the UAE typically costs AED 8,000–18,000 for a budget laminate kitchen, AED 18,000–45,000 for a mid-range acrylic/MDF kitchen and AED 50,000–150,000+ for premium or imported units. Per linear metre it is roughly AED 1,500–6,000. Price depends on size and materials — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-electrical-work-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g34175\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#14B8A6\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#08222A\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g34175)\"/><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"9\" r=\"34\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"386\" cy=\"206\" r=\"86\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M27 6 L13 27 h9 l-2 15 L35 19 h-9 z\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke=\"none\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does electrical work cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, an electrician call-out is about AED 100–250, replacing a DB/distribution board AED 800–2,500, and per wiring point AED 60–180. A full villa rewire runs AED 8,000–35,000. Price depends on scope and access — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-plumbing-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g73301\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#15807A\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g73301)\"/><circle cx=\"621\" cy=\"62\" r=\"205\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"556\" cy=\"359\" r=\"102\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M24 7 C24 7 13 21 13 30 a11 11 0 0 0 22 0 C35 21 24 7 24 7 Z\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does plumbing cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, a plumber call-out is about AED 100–250, a tap/mixer replacement AED 80–300, a water heater supply + install AED 600–2,000, and leak detection AED 250–800. A full bathroom re-plumb runs AED 2,500–8,000. Price depends on the job — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-fit-out-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g51805\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#14B8A6\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#08222A\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g51805)\"/><circle cx=\"645\" cy=\"75\" r=\"163\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"658\" cy=\"264\" r=\"103\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M8 24 L24 10 L40 24 M12 21 V40 H36 V21\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does a fit-out cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, an apartment fit-out typically costs AED 60–250 per sqft, an office fit-out AED 80–300 per sqft, and a retail fit-out AED 150–400 per sqft. A villa renovation commonly runs AED 150,000–800,000+ depending on scope. Price depends on finish level — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-waterproofing-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g74274\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0F766E\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g74274)\"/><circle cx=\"634\" cy=\"184\" r=\"206\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"759\" cy=\"369\" r=\"109\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M24 7 C24 7 13 21 13 30 a11 11 0 0 0 22 0 C35 21 24 7 24 7 Z\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does waterproofing cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, roof/terrace waterproofing typically costs AED 25–70 per sqm, bathroom waterproofing AED 400–1,200 per bathroom, and water-tank waterproofing AED 800–3,000. Price depends on area, system and prep — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-tiling-marble-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g30536\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0B8276\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#0C2330\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g30536)\"/><circle cx=\"336\" cy=\"117\" r=\"159\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"747\" cy=\"356\" r=\"94\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M8 8 H40 V40 H8 Z M24 8 V40 M8 24 H40\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does tiling &amp; marble work cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, tile fixing labour is about AED 25–60 per sqm, marble fixing AED 60–150 per sqm, and marble polishing AED 12–40 per sqm. Supply + fix tiles runs AED 40–120 per sqm. Price depends on material and area — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-pest-control-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g92545\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#15807A\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g92545)\"/><circle cx=\"665\" cy=\"118\" r=\"152\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"595\" cy=\"338\" r=\"159\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><ellipse cx=\"24\" cy=\"27\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"11\"/><path d=\"M24 16 V10 M15 22 L8 18 M33 22 L40 18 M15 32 L8 35 M33 32 L40 35\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does pest control cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, a general pest treatment costs about AED 120–350 for an apartment and AED 300–800 for a villa. Bed-bug treatment runs AED 300–1,200 and termite treatment AED 800–4,000. Annual contracts are AED 600–2,500. Price depends on size and pest — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-swimming-pool-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g39277\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#116E67\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g39277)\"/><circle cx=\"357\" cy=\"47\" r=\"104\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"441\" cy=\"200\" r=\"85\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M5 22 q6-6 12 0 t12 0 t14 0 M5 32 q6-6 12 0 t12 0 t14 0\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does a swimming pool cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, a standard concrete pool typically costs AED 60,000–150,000, a fibreglass pool AED 45,000–120,000, and large or infinity pools AED 150,000–500,000+. Monthly maintenance runs AED 350–800. Price depends on size, finish and features — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-movers-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g22651\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#14B8A6\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#08222A\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g22651)\"/><circle cx=\"451\" cy=\"181\" r=\"152\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"618\" cy=\"254\" r=\"151\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M8 17 L24 9 40 17 24 25 Z M8 17 V35 L24 43 V25 M40 17 V35 L24 43\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much do movers cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, a studio move typically costs AED 300–700, a 1-bedroom AED 500–1,200, a 2-bedroom AED 900–2,200, and a villa AED 2,500–8,000. Packing materials and storage are extra. Price depends on size, distance and floors — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-handyman-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g8829\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#15807A\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g8829)\"/><circle cx=\"309\" cy=\"53\" r=\"180\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"662\" cy=\"315\" r=\"93\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"M24 8 V13 M24 35 V40 M8 24 H13 M35 24 H40 M12 12 L16 16 M32 32 L36 36 M36 12 L32 16 M16 32 L12 36\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does a handyman cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, a handyman charges about AED 80–200 per hour or AED 250–500 for a half-day. TV mounting runs AED 100–300 and furniture assembly AED 100–400. Price depends on the task and time — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-ac-duct-cleaning-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g78640\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0B8276\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#0C2330\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g78640)\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"-32\" r=\"69\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"243\" r=\"50\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M24 6 V42 M6 24 H42 M11 11 L37 37 M37 11 L11 37\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does AC duct cleaning cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, AC duct cleaning typically costs AED 400–1,200 for an apartment and AED 800–2,500 for a villa, or about AED 40–120 per air outlet. Sanitization adds to the price. It depends on size and duct length — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-smart-home-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g97374\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0D9488\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#08222A\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g97374)\"/><circle cx=\"614\" cy=\"121\" r=\"167\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"599\" cy=\"349\" r=\"124\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M8 24 L24 10 L40 24 M12 21 V40 H36 V21\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does smart home automation cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, a basic smart-home starter setup typically costs AED 3,000–12,000, a full apartment AED 15,000–50,000, and full villa automation AED 50,000–250,000+. Per room it is roughly AED 2,000–8,000. Price depends on system and coverage — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-solar-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g32046\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0D9488\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#08222A\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g32046)\"/><circle cx=\"246\" cy=\"55\" r=\"121\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"655\" cy=\"333\" r=\"103\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"M24 4 V10 M24 38 V44 M4 24 H10 M38 24 H44 M9 9 L13 13 M35 35 L39 39 M39 9 L35 13 M13 35 L9 39\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does solar cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, residential rooftop solar typically costs about AED 3,500–6,000 per kWp installed, so a 10–20 kWp villa system runs roughly AED 40,000–120,000. Commercial systems are cheaper per kWp. Price depends on size and approvals — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-curtains-blinds-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g45329\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#116E67\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g45329)\"/><circle cx=\"409\" cy=\"66\" r=\"206\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"639\" cy=\"379\" r=\"102\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M9 8 H39 M14 8 V38 q3-4 0-8 M22 8 V38 q3-4 0-8 M30 8 V38 q3-4 0-8\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much do curtains &amp; blinds cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, curtains typically cost AED 300–1,500 per window, roller blinds AED 80–250 per sqm, and motorized blinds AED 800–3,000 per window. Blackout and sheer layers add to the price. It depends on fabric and size — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-false-ceiling-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g41658\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0F766E\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g41658)\"/><circle cx=\"418\" cy=\"157\" r=\"161\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"560\" cy=\"270\" r=\"132\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M8 24 L24 10 L40 24 M12 21 V40 H36 V21\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does a false ceiling cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, a plain gypsum false ceiling typically costs AED 35–70 per sqm, a designed/cove ceiling AED 60–120 per sqm, and a gypsum partition AED 60–130 per sqm. Price depends on design and board type — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-landscaping-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g66013\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#116E67\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g66013)\"/><circle cx=\"373\" cy=\"-61\" r=\"69\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"402\" cy=\"160\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M12 38 C12 20 28 9 40 9 40 21 30 38 12 38 Z M14 36 C20 30 28 24 36 20\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does landscaping cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, artificial grass typically costs AED 45–120 per sqm installed, natural turf AED 25–60 per sqm, and a full garden landscaping project AED 15,000–120,000. Irrigation systems run AED 3,000–20,000. Price depends on area and features — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-aluminium-glass-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g40943\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#14B8A6\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#08222A\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g40943)\"/><circle cx=\"503\" cy=\"167\" r=\"179\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"692\" cy=\"273\" r=\"140\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M24 8 V40 M10 24 H38\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much do aluminium &amp; glass works cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, glass partitions typically cost AED 250–700 per sqm, a shower enclosure AED 800–3,500, aluminium windows AED 250–800 per sqm, and a glass pergola AED 350–900 per sqm. Price depends on glass type and framing — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-signage-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g24295\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#14B8A6\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#08222A\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g24295)\"/><circle cx=\"655\" cy=\"24\" r=\"106\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"291\" cy=\"242\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M24 27 V40 M16 40 H32\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does signage cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, 3D acrylic letters typically cost AED 150–800 per letter, a light box about AED 80–250 per sqft, and vinyl/sticker work AED 15–60 per sqft. Large pylon signage runs AED 5,000–50,000+. Price depends on type, size and lighting — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-facilities-management-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g68400\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0B8276\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#0C2330\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g68400)\"/><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"150\" r=\"197\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"599\" cy=\"329\" r=\"149\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"M24 8 V13 M24 35 V40 M8 24 H13 M35 24 H40 M12 12 L16 16 M32 32 L36 36 M36 12 L32 16 M16 32 L12 36\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>How much does facilities management cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>In the UAE, facilities management is typically priced per square foot per year — roughly AED 8–25/sqft for soft + hard FM, depending on services. AMC packages for MEP and common areas vary by building. Price depends on scope and building size — get free, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/cost-of-building-materials-uae/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g42222\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0B8276\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#0C2330\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g42222)\"/><circle cx=\"662\" cy=\"177\" r=\"159\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"687\" cy=\"251\" r=\"130\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M8 17 L24 9 40 17 24 25 Z M8 17 V35 L24 43 V25 M40 17 V35 L24 43\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost guides</span><h2>Building &amp; fit-out material prices in the UAE (2026): steel, MDF, acrylic, glass &amp; more</h2><p>Indicative UAE material prices: reinforcement steel about AED 2,200–3,200 per ton, MDF (18mm) AED 60–120 per sheet, acrylic sheet AED 60–180 per sqm, clear glass (6mm) AED 35–90 per sqm and cement AED 12–18 per bag. Commodity prices move weekly — get live, comparable quotes on QuotesDone.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/how-much-does-an-annual-ac-maintenance-contract-cost-in-the-uae-2026-p/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost Guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g87921\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#14B8A6\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#08222A\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g87921)\"/><circle cx=\"521\" cy=\"140\" r=\"172\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"608\" cy=\"302\" r=\"140\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><path d=\"M24 6 V42 M6 24 H42 M11 11 L37 37 M37 11 L11 37\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost Guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost Guides</span><h2>How much does an annual AC maintenance contract cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>What should you pay for an annual AC maintenance contract in the UAE in 2026? Real price ranges per unit, what a good AMC covers, and how to compare quotes without overpaying.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"bpost\" href=\"/blog/how-much-does-office-partition-installation-cost-in-the-uae-2026-price/\"><div class=\"bcover\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\"  xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cost Guides\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"g63263\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#15807A\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#06121B\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\"800\" height=\"450\" fill=\"url(#g63263)\"/><circle cx=\"583\" cy=\"157\" r=\"161\" fill=\"#ffffff\" opacity=\"0.05\"/><circle cx=\"560\" cy=\"320\" r=\"102\" fill=\"#14B8A6\" opacity=\"0.08\"/><g transform=\"translate(300,78) scale(4.4)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#EAF4F2\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.9\"><rect x=\"12\" y=\"8\" width=\"24\" height=\"32\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M17 18 H31 M17 24 H31 M17 30 H26\"/></g><rect x=\"48\" y=\"372\" width=\"40\" height=\"4\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E3C065\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"407\" fill=\"#EAF4F2\" font-family=\"Sora,Inter,sans-serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost Guides</text></svg></div><div class=\"bbody\"><span class=\"bchip\">Cost Guides</span><h2>How much does office partition installation cost in the UAE? (2026 price guide)</h2><p>A clear 2026 breakdown of office partition costs in the UAE — glass, gypsum and demountable systems, price ranges per square metre, and how to compare quotes.</p><span class=\"more\">Read guide →</span></div></a></div></section><section><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Ready to get quotes?</b> Describe your job once and compare anonymised quotes from vetted UAE suppliers. <a href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></section></div>"
