"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Signage &amp; 3D Letters in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted signage &amp; 3d letters suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get signage &amp; 3d letters quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-signage-uae/\">typical Signage &amp; 3D Letters prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Signage and 3D letters are essential for businesses across {{LOC_THE}} looking to make a strong first impression, whether you're fitting out a new retail unit in Dubai Mall, branding a corporate office in Abu Dhabi, or marking a warehouse in Sharjah's industrial zones. The scope can range from illuminated fascia signs and laser-cut acrylic letters to full building wraps and wayfinding systems. Costs vary considerably depending on materials (aluminium, acrylic, stainless steel), size, lighting type (LED, backlit, halo-lit), installation complexity, and whether municipality approvals are required. Getting several quotes from vetted signage companies through QuotesDone lets you compare pricing, lead times, and craftsmanship — completely free.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Fabrication and installation of illuminated 3D channel letters for shopfronts or building facades</li><li>Backlit or halo-lit acrylic and aluminium sign boxes for retail and commercial units</li><li>Laser-cut stainless steel or brass reception logos and interior branding letters</li><li>Vehicle and fleet vinyl wrapping and graphics for corporate branding</li><li>Wayfinding and directional signage systems for offices, malls, and residential complexes</li><li>Outdoor hoarding, billboard, and pylon sign fabrication with municipality permit assistance</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Signage &amp; 3D Letters in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of 3D letters and signage in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Key cost drivers include the material chosen (stainless steel and brass cost more than acrylic), the overall size and number of letters, the type of illumination (LED halo-lit being premium), and whether the installation requires scaffolding or a cherry picker for high-rise facades. Municipality permit fees in emirates such as Dubai or Abu Dhabi can also add to the total.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does it typically take to produce and install a signage project?</b><div>Most standard fabricated signs and 3D letter sets take between 7 and 21 working days from artwork approval to installation, depending on complexity and material availability. Projects requiring municipality approvals may add extra time, so it is worth discussing timelines with your supplier before confirming the order.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check when comparing signage quotes in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Ensure each quote clearly specifies the material grade, lighting type, warranty period, and whether municipality permit applications and installation are included in the price. Also confirm whether the supplier handles artwork and shop drawings in-house, as this can significantly affect both quality and turnaround time.</div></div></section><section><h2>Signage &amp; 3D Letters across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/signage-in-dubai/\">Signage &amp; 3D Letters in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/signage-in-abu-dhabi/\">Signage &amp; 3D Letters in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/signage-in-sharjah/\">Signage &amp; 3D Letters in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/signage-in-ajman/\">Signage &amp; 3D Letters in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/signage-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Signage &amp; 3D Letters in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/signage-in-fujairah/\">Signage &amp; 3D Letters in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/signage-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Signage &amp; 3D Letters in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a></div></section></div>",
