urface preparation and the number of coats applied. Drying times can be faster in {{LOC_THE}}'s dry climate, though air conditioning settings can affect how quickly paint cures between coats.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check when comparing painting quotes in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Ensure each quote clearly states the brand and grade of paint to be used, the number of coats included, and whether surface preparation is covered — these details vary significantly between contractors. Also confirm whether the price includes moving or protecting furniture, masking fittings, and any post-job clean-up, so you're comparing like for like.</div></div></section><section><h2>Painting &amp; Decorating across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/painting-in-dubai/\">Painting &amp; Decorating in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/painting-in-abu-dhabi/\">Painting &amp; Decorating in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/painting-in-sharjah/\">Painting &amp; Decorating in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/painting-in-ajman/\">Painting &amp; Decorating in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/painting-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Painting &amp; Decorating in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/painting-in-fujairah/\">Painting &amp; Decorating in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/painting-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Painting &amp; Decorating in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a></div></section></div>",
