replacement or upgrade, including circuit breaker installation</li><li>Complete villa or apartment rewiring and cable replacement</li><li>Power point, light switch, and socket installation or relocation</li><li>Outdoor and garden lighting installation, including low-voltage and LED systems</li><li>DEWA or ADDC connection application support and inspection preparation</li><li>Fault finding, circuit testing, and repair of tripping or dead circuits</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Electrical Work &amp; Contractors in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of electrical work in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Pricing depends on the scope of work, property size, type of materials used, and whether authority approvals from DEWA or ADDC are needed. Emergency call-outs and work in older buildings that require remedial upgrades will also increase the overall cost.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Do electricians in {{LOC_THE}} need to be licensed, and how can I verify this?</b><div>Yes — electrical contractors must hold a valid trade licence and, for utility-related work, be registered with the relevant authority such as DEWA in Dubai or ADDC in Abu Dhabi. Always ask a contractor to share their licence number and check it on the relevant authority's website before work begins.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a typical electrical job take to complete?</b><div>Minor repairs or additional socket installations can often be completed within a few hours, while a full rewire of a villa may take several days to a week. Jobs requiring authority inspection and sign-off will add extra time, so factor this in when planning a renovation or handover deadline.</div></div></section><section><h2>Electrical Work &amp; Contractors across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/electrical-in-dubai/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/electrical-in-abu-dhabi/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/electrical-in-sharjah/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/electrical-in-ajman/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/electrical-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/electrical-in-fujairah/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/electrical-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a><a href=\"/services/pest-control/\">Pest Control</a></div></section></div>",
