"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Smart Home Automation in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted smart home automation suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get smart home automation quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-smart-home-uae/\">typical Smart Home Automation prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Smart home automation transforms your {{LOC}} property into an intelligently connected living space, allowing you to control lighting, climate, security, entertainment, and appliances from a single app or voice command. It's popular across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Sharjah villas and apartments alike, particularly where residents want to manage energy costs during peak summer months. The scope and cost depend on the size of your home, the number of devices integrated, the brand ecosystem chosen, and whether you need full retrofitting or are building from scratch. Whether you're after a basic smart lighting setup or a fully integrated KNX or Control4 system, comparing several quotes through QuotesDone is free and helps you find the right specialist at the right price.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Smart lighting control installation, including dimmers, scenes, and scheduling across multiple rooms</li><li>Automated HVAC and air-conditioning control integrated with smart thermostats or existing AC units</li><li>Smart security setup including video doorbells, IP cameras, smart locks, and remote monitoring</li><li>Home theatre and multi-room audio/video system integration and programming</li><li>Motorised blinds, curtains, and shading systems linked to lighting or time-of-day schedules</li><li>Centralised control hub setup with app configuration, voice assistant integration, and user training</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Smart Home Automation in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of a smart home automation system in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Cost is primarily driven by the size of your property, the number of devices and rooms covered, and the brand tier you choose — entry-level systems differ significantly in price from premium platforms like Control4 or Crestron. Retrofitting an existing villa also typically costs more than installing during construction due to additional wiring and concealment work.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a smart home installation typically take?</b><div>A basic single-room or partial setup can be completed in one to two days, while a full-villa integration covering lighting, HVAC, security, and AV may take one to three weeks depending on complexity and any civil works required. Your installer should provide a clear project timeline in their quote.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check when comparing smart home automation quotes in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Ensure each quote specifies the exact brands and number of devices included, whether programming and commissioning are covered, and what after-sales support or warranty is offered. Also confirm whether the supplier is an authorised dealer or certified integrator for the system they are proposing.</div></div></section><section><h2>Smart Home Automation across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/smart-home-in-dubai/\">Smart Home Automation in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/smart-home-in-abu-dhabi/\">Smart Home Automation in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/smart-home-in-sharjah/\">Smart Home Automation in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/smart-home-in-ajman/\">Smart Home Automation in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/smart-home-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Smart Home Automation in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/smart-home-in-fujairah/\">Smart Home Automation in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/smart-home-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Smart Home Automation in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a></div></section></div>",
