"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Landscaping &amp; Garden Design in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted landscaping &amp; garden design suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get landscaping &amp; garden design quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-landscaping-uae/\">typical Landscaping &amp; Garden Design prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Landscaping and garden design in {{LOC_THE}} transforms outdoor spaces into functional, attractive areas suited to the region's climate and lifestyle. Whether you own a villa in Dubai, a townhouse in Abu Dhabi, or a commercial property in Sharjah, a professional landscaper can design and install everything from irrigation systems and lawn turf to pergolas and planting schemes. Costs vary depending on plot size, soil preparation requirements, the choice of plants (drought-tolerant species typically cost less to maintain), hardscaping materials, and ongoing maintenance needs. Getting several quotes allows you to compare design approaches, material quality, and service inclusions before committing. On QuotesDone, you can request multiple proposals from vetted {{LOC}} landscaping companies completely free of charge.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Full garden design and layout planning, including 2D or 3D concept drawings</li><li>Supply and installation of lawn turf or artificial grass</li><li>Drip irrigation and automated sprinkler system installation</li><li>Planting of trees, shrubs, and drought-tolerant or ornamental plants</li><li>Hardscaping works including pathways, decking, pergolas, and boundary walls</li><li>Ongoing garden maintenance packages covering trimming, fertilising, and irrigation servicing</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Landscaping &amp; Garden Design in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of landscaping a villa garden in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Key cost drivers include the size of the plot, the complexity of the design, choice of materials (natural stone versus porcelain, for example), plant selection, and whether irrigation needs to be installed from scratch. Soil improvement works, which are often necessary in sandy {{LOC}} terrain, can also add to the overall budget.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a typical garden landscaping project take to complete?</b><div>A straightforward residential garden can take one to three weeks, while larger or more complex projects involving significant hardscaping, custom features, or extensive planting may run four to eight weeks. Your landscaper should provide a clear project timeline in their quote.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check when comparing landscaping quotes in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Look for a detailed breakdown of materials, plant species, irrigation specifications, and labour costs, and confirm whether the quote includes soil preparation and waste removal. Also check whether the company offers a defects or plant-replacement guarantee, as heat and humidity can affect newly installed plants during the establishment period.</div></div></section><section><h2>Landscaping &amp; Garden Design across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/landscaping-in-dubai/\">Landscaping &amp; Garden Design in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/landscaping-in-abu-dhabi/\">Landscaping &amp; Garden Design in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/landscaping-in-sharjah/\">Landscaping &amp; Garden Design in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/landscaping-in-ajman/\">Landscaping &amp; Garden Design in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/landscaping-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Landscaping &amp; Garden Design in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/landscaping-in-fujairah/\">Landscaping &amp; Garden Design in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/landscaping-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Landscaping &amp; Garden Design in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a></div></section></div>",
