it setup with appropriate storage capacity</li><li>Structured cabling and conduit work for wired camera runs</li><li>Remote viewing configuration via mobile app or web portal</li><li>Integration with existing alarm systems or access control panels</li><li>Annual maintenance contract and periodic system health checks</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>CCTV &amp; Security Systems in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of CCTV installation in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>The main cost drivers are the number of cameras, their resolution and type (bullet, dome, PTZ), whether installation is indoors or outdoors, cabling complexity, and the storage solution chosen. A small villa setup will cost significantly less than a multi-floor commercial fit-out in AED terms.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>Do I need a permit or licence for CCTV installation in Dubai or Abu Dhabi?</b><div>Commercial and certain residential CCTV installations in {{LOC_THE}} may require approval from authorities such as Dubai Police or Abu Dhabi Police; a reputable installer will handle the permit process on your behalf. Always confirm this is included in your quote before work begins.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check before accepting a CCTV installation quote?</b><div>Ensure the quote specifies camera brands, resolution, storage duration, warranty terms, and whether remote access setup is included. Also confirm the contractor holds a valid trade licence and any required security system installation approvals from the relevant emirate authority.</div></div></section><section><h2>CCTV &amp; Security Systems across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/cctv-security-in-dubai/\">CCTV &amp; Security Systems in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/cctv-security-in-abu-dhabi/\">CCTV &amp; Security Systems in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/cctv-security-in-sharjah/\">CCTV &amp; Security Systems in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/cctv-security-in-ajman/\">CCTV &amp; Security Systems in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/cctv-security-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">CCTV &amp; Security Systems in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/cctv-security-in-fujairah/\">CCTV &amp; Security Systems in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/cctv-security-in-umm-al-quwain/\">CCTV &amp; Security Systems in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a></div></section></div>",
