"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted false ceiling &amp; gypsum partitions suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get false ceiling &amp; gypsum partitions quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-false-ceiling-uae/\">typical False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>False ceilings and gypsum partitions are among the most popular interior fit-out choices across {{LOC}} homes, offices, and retail spaces — from compact Dubai apartments to sprawling Abu Dhabi villas. A false ceiling can conceal wiring and ductwork, improve acoustics, and add decorative appeal through coves, recesses, or LED lighting channels. Gypsum board partitions offer a cost-effective way to divide open-plan areas without heavy construction. Costs vary depending on ceiling height, design complexity, the grade of gypsum board specified, and finishing requirements such as skim coating or paint. Labour rates also differ across emirates. On QuotesDone, you can describe your project once and receive several competitive quotes from vetted contractors — completely free.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Standard flat gypsum false ceiling installation with taped and skimmed finish ready for painting</li><li>Decorative cove or tray ceiling design with integrated LED lighting channels</li><li>Gypsum board partition walls with metal stud framing for room division or office layouts</li><li>Curved or multi-level dropped ceiling features for living rooms, majlis, or reception areas</li><li>Acoustic or moisture-resistant gypsum board installation for bathrooms, kitchens, or home theatres</li><li>Dismantling of existing false ceiling or partitions and disposal of old materials before new installation</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of a false ceiling in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Pricing depends on the total square footage, ceiling height, design complexity (flat versus multi-level or cove), and the type of gypsum board used — standard, moisture-resistant, or fire-rated. Finishing requirements such as skim coating, priming, and paint are often quoted separately, so confirm what is included.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a typical gypsum false ceiling or partition project take?</b><div>A straightforward flat ceiling in a standard bedroom or living room usually takes two to four days, while complex multi-level designs or full apartment fit-outs can take one to three weeks. Drying and curing time for jointing compound should be factored in before painting begins.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check before accepting a gypsum contractor's quote?</b><div>Ensure the quote specifies the brand and grade of gypsum board, the thickness of metal studs, whether skim coating and paint are included, and how waste disposal is handled. Also confirm the contractor holds a valid trade licence in your emirate and that the quote covers any required access to existing MEP services above the ceiling.</div></div></section><section><h2>False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/false-ceiling-in-dubai/\">False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/false-ceiling-in-abu-dhabi/\">False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/false-ceiling-in-sharjah/\">False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/false-ceiling-in-ajman/\">False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/false-ceiling-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/false-ceiling-in-fujairah/\">False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/false-ceiling-in-umm-al-quwain/\">False Ceiling &amp; Gypsum Partitions in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a></div></section></div>",
