"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Tiling &amp; Marble Work in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted tiling &amp; marble work suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get tiling &amp; marble work quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-tiling-marble-uae/\">typical Tiling &amp; Marble Work prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Tiling and marble work covers the supply and installation of floor tiles, wall tiles, and natural or engineered stone across residential and commercial properties throughout {{LOC_THE}}. Homeowners renovating kitchens, bathrooms, or living areas, as well as developers fitting out villas and apartments in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Sharjah, regularly need these services. Costs vary depending on the material chosen — from ceramic and porcelain to Carrara marble or locally sourced stone — the surface area, subfloor preparation required, and the complexity of the laying pattern. Grouting, waterproofing, and finishing edges all add to the overall scope. Because quotes can differ significantly between contractors, comparing several proposals through QuotesDone helps you secure fair pricing and a skilled tradesperson suited to your project.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Floor tile installation in living rooms, kitchens, or bedrooms</li><li>Bathroom wall tiling including wet-area waterproofing</li><li>Marble slab fitting for floors, staircases, or feature walls</li><li>Tile removal and subfloor preparation before new installation</li><li>Grouting, sealing, and edge-trim finishing</li><li>Outdoor tiling for balconies, terraces, and pool surrounds</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Tiling &amp; Marble Work in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of tiling and marble work in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>The main cost drivers are the material selected (ceramic being the most affordable, natural marble significantly more expensive), the total square footage, and the complexity of the pattern or cuts required. Subfloor levelling, waterproofing, and whether old tiles need removing will also add to the final price.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a typical tiling project take to complete?</b><div>A standard bathroom tiling job usually takes two to four days, while larger areas such as a full villa floor can take one to two weeks depending on the team size and material availability. Allow additional curing time for adhesive and grout before the area is used.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check when comparing tiling quotes in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Ensure each quote clearly states whether materials are included or priced separately, specifies the tile adhesive and grout quality, and covers waste removal and finishing trims. Confirm the contractor is experienced with your chosen material — marble in particular requires specialist handling to avoid cracking or staining.</div></div></section><section><h2>Tiling &amp; Marble Work across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble-in-dubai/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble-in-abu-dhabi/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble-in-sharjah/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble-in-ajman/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble-in-fujairah/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/pest-control/\">Pest Control</a></div></section></div>",
