"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Waterproofing Services in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted waterproofing services suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get waterproofing services quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-waterproofing-uae/\">typical Waterproofing Services prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Waterproofing services protect {{LOC}} homes and buildings from water ingress, damp, and structural damage caused by heavy rainfall, humidity, and roof-level water tanks. Whether you need a flat roof sealed before summer, a basement tanked, or a bathroom wet area treated, the right solution depends on the surface type, existing damage, and materials used. Scope and cost vary considerably based on the area to be treated, accessibility, the waterproofing system chosen — such as liquid membrane, bitumen sheet, or crystalline coating — and whether surface repairs are needed beforehand. Across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, and beyond, getting several quotes lets you compare methods, warranties, and pricing. On QuotesDone, you can request multiple quotes from vetted waterproofing specialists completely free.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Flat roof and terrace waterproofing using liquid or sheet membrane systems</li><li>Bathroom and wet room waterproofing beneath tiles</li><li>Basement and underground structure tanking</li><li>Water tank and swimming pool waterproofing treatment</li><li>Balcony and podium deck waterproofing with drainage slope correction</li><li>Remedial crack injection and damp-proofing for existing water ingress</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Waterproofing Services in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of waterproofing in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>The main cost drivers are the surface area to be treated, the type of waterproofing system specified, the condition of the existing substrate, and accessibility — rooftop work on a high-rise will cost more than a ground-floor bathroom. Material quality and the length of the workmanship warranty offered also influence the final price in AED.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a waterproofing job typically take to complete?</b><div>A standard bathroom or small roof area can usually be completed in one to three days, while larger projects such as a full building podium or basement may take one to two weeks. Curing time for the membrane must be factored in before tiles or finishes are applied on top.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check when comparing waterproofing quotes?</b><div>Look for the specific system and brand of membrane being used, the number of coats or layers included, and whether surface preparation and minor repairs are covered in the price. Most importantly, confirm the warranty period — reputable contractors in {{LOC_THE}} typically offer a five- to ten-year workmanship guarantee.</div></div></section><section><h2>Waterproofing Services across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/waterproofing-in-dubai/\">Waterproofing Services in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing-in-abu-dhabi/\">Waterproofing Services in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing-in-sharjah/\">Waterproofing Services in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing-in-ajman/\">Waterproofing Services in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Waterproofing Services in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing-in-fujairah/\">Waterproofing Services in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Waterproofing Services in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a><a href=\"/services/pest-control/\">Pest Control</a></div></section></div>",
