"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted swimming pool construction &amp; maintenance suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get swimming pool construction &amp; maintenance quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-swimming-pool-uae/\">typical Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Swimming pool construction and maintenance in {{LOC_THE}} covers everything from initial design and excavation through to tiling, filtration systems, lighting, and ongoing chemical upkeep. Homeowners in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and across the emirates commission pools for private villas, compounds, and commercial properties, while maintenance contracts suit anyone wanting their pool kept safe and sparkling year-round. Costs vary considerably depending on pool size and shape, finish materials (mosaic tiles, fibreglass, or pebblecrete), water features, heating or chilling systems, and site accessibility. Ongoing maintenance frequency also affects overall spend. Through QuotesDone, you can describe your project once and receive several competitive quotes from vetted swimming pool contractors — completely free — making it straightforward to compare expertise, timelines, and pricing before committing.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Full in-ground pool construction including excavation, steel reinforcement, and shotcrete shell</li><li>Pool tiling and interior finishing with mosaic, fibreglass, or pebblecrete surfaces</li><li>Filtration, pump, and circulation system supply and installation</li><li>LED underwater lighting and water feature installation (fountains, waterfalls, jets)</li><li>Pool heating or chilling system installation for year-round comfortable use</li><li>Regular maintenance contracts covering chemical balancing, cleaning, and equipment checks</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors most affect the cost of building a swimming pool in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Pool size, shape complexity, and choice of interior finish (mosaic tiles being premium, fibreglass more economical) are the biggest cost drivers. Additional features such as infinity edges, water features, heating or chilling units, and the difficulty of site access will also increase the overall price significantly.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does it typically take to construct a new swimming pool in Dubai or Abu Dhabi?</b><div>A standard residential in-ground pool generally takes between six and twelve weeks from excavation to handover, depending on size and finish complexity. Delays can occur during municipality permit approvals, so it is worth confirming with your contractor how they handle the approvals process.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I look for when comparing swimming pool contractor quotes in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Ensure each quote clearly itemises excavation, shell construction, tiling, filtration equipment, and any water features, rather than offering a single lump sum. Also check whether the quote includes a warranty period, municipality permit fees, and whether an ongoing maintenance package is available after handover.</div></div></section><section><h2>Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/swimming-pools-in-dubai/\">Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/swimming-pools-in-abu-dhabi/\">Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/swimming-pools-in-sharjah/\">Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/swimming-pools-in-ajman/\">Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/swimming-pools-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/swimming-pools-in-fujairah/\">Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/swimming-pools-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Swimming Pool Construction &amp; Maintenance in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">