"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Aluminium &amp; Glass Works in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted aluminium &amp; glass works suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get aluminium &amp; glass works quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-aluminium-glass-uae/\">typical Aluminium &amp; Glass Works prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Aluminium and glass works cover a broad range of fabrication and installation services for residential and commercial properties across {{LOC_THE}}, from sliding doors and window frames to curtain walling and shower enclosures. Homeowners renovating villas in Dubai or Abu Dhabi, developers fitting out apartments, and business owners upgrading shopfronts all regularly commission this type of work. Costs vary depending on the aluminium profile grade, glass type (clear, tinted, frosted, or double-glazed), the complexity of the design, and the total area involved. Labour rates can also differ between emirates. Because specifications and pricing vary considerably between suppliers, it pays to compare several quotes before committing. Through QuotesDone, you can request multiple quotes from vetted {{LOC}} contractors completely free of charge.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Supply and installation of aluminium window frames and sliding windows</li><li>Aluminium-framed glass doors, including sliding, folding, and swing configurations</li><li>Shopfront and commercial entrance glazing with aluminium profiles</li><li>Curtain wall and structural glazing systems for buildings</li><li>Frameless and semi-frameless glass shower enclosures and partitions</li><li>Aluminium pergola and canopy structures with polycarbonate or glass infill panels</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Aluminium &amp; Glass Works in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of aluminium and glass works in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Key cost drivers include the grade and finish of the aluminium profile (powder-coated, anodised, or mill finish), the type and thickness of glass specified, and the total square meterage to be covered. Custom shapes, high-rise access requirements, and premium brands will also push the price higher.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a typical aluminium and glass installation take?</b><div>Straightforward residential jobs such as replacing windows or fitting a shower enclosure can be completed within one to three days, while larger commercial projects like shopfronts or curtain walling may take several weeks from fabrication to final installation. Lead times for custom fabrication should be confirmed with your contractor upfront.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check when comparing quotes for aluminium and glass works?</b><div>Ensure each quote specifies the aluminium profile brand and series, the glass type and thickness, whether a warranty is included on both materials and workmanship, and whether removal of existing frames is covered. Comparing like-for-like specifications makes it much easier to assess true value across different suppliers.</div></div></section><section><h2>Aluminium &amp; Glass Works across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/aluminium-glass-in-dubai/\">Aluminium &amp; Glass Works in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/aluminium-glass-in-abu-dhabi/\">Aluminium &amp; Glass Works in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/aluminium-glass-in-sharjah/\">Aluminium &amp; Glass Works in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/aluminium-glass-in-ajman/\">Aluminium &amp; Glass Works in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/aluminium-glass-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Aluminium &amp; Glass Works in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/aluminium-glass-in-fujairah/\">Aluminium &amp; Glass Works in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/aluminium-glass-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Aluminium &amp; Glass Works in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a></div></section></div>",
