"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Curtains &amp; Blinds in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted curtains &amp; blinds suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get curtains &amp; blinds quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-curtains-blinds-uae/\">typical Curtains &amp; Blinds prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Curtains and blinds transform the look and feel of any home or office, offering privacy, light control, and insulation against {{LOC_THE}}'s intense heat and sun. Whether you're furnishing a new apartment in Dubai, refreshing a villa in Abu Dhabi, or fitting out a commercial space in Sharjah, the right window treatments make a significant difference. Costs vary depending on window size, fabric quality, mechanism type (motorised or manual), and the number of rooms involved. Installation complexity and custom-made versus ready-made options also affect the final price. On QuotesDone, you can describe your requirements and receive several competitive quotes from vetted curtain and blinds suppliers across {{LOC_THE}} — completely free and with no obligation to commit.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Supply and installation of blackout curtains for bedrooms</li><li>Motorised roller blinds fitted to living room or office windows</li><li>Sheer or voile curtain hanging with curtain tracks or rods</li><li>Venetian or vertical blinds for kitchen and bathroom windows</li><li>Custom-made curtains measured, sewn, and installed to specification</li><li>Replacement or repair of existing blinds mechanisms and fittings</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Curtains &amp; Blinds in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of curtains and blinds in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Pricing depends on the fabric or material chosen, the number and size of windows, whether the product is custom-made or off-the-shelf, and whether motorisation is required. Installation charges can also vary between suppliers, so comparing multiple quotes is the best way to understand the full cost.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a typical curtains and blinds installation take?</b><div>A standard residential installation covering several rooms can usually be completed within one day, once the products are ready. Custom-made curtains or motorised blinds may require a lead time of one to three weeks for manufacturing before the fitting appointment.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check when reviewing a curtains and blinds quote?</b><div>Ensure the quote clearly separates the cost of materials from installation labour, and confirms whether a site survey, curtain tracks or rods, and any motorisation hardware are included. Also check