"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted interior design &amp; fit-out suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get interior design &amp; fit-out quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-fit-out-uae/\">typical Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Interior design and fit-out services cover everything from initial concept and space planning through to the final finishing touches that make a property truly liveable or commercially functional. Whether you're transforming a new-build apartment in Dubai Marina, refurbishing a villa in Abu Dhabi, or fitting out a retail or office space across any {{LOC}} emirate, the scope and cost vary considerably depending on the size of the space, quality of materials, level of customisation, and whether structural changes are involved. Engaging a professional fit-out team ensures joinery, flooring, lighting, and soft furnishings all come together cohesively. Because pricing differs widely between contractors, it pays to compare several detailed quotes before committing. Through QuotesDone, you can request multiple proposals from vetted {{LOC}} suppliers completely free of charge.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Full space planning, mood board creation, and 3D concept design for residential or commercial properties</li><li>Custom joinery and built-in furniture fabrication, including wardrobes, kitchen cabinetry, and shelving units</li><li>Flooring supply and installation, covering marble, porcelain tiles, engineered wood, or luxury vinyl</li><li>False ceiling design and installation, including gypsum board, cove lighting, and decorative features</li><li>Bathroom and kitchen fit-out, including tiling, sanitary ware installation, and fixture selection</li><li>Painting, wall cladding, wallpaper installation, and decorative finishes throughout the property</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of an interior fit-out in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Key cost drivers include the total area in square feet, the grade of materials selected, the complexity of custom joinery, and whether MEP (mechanical, electrical, and plumbing) works are required. Fit-outs in prime locations such as Downtown Dubai or Saadiyat Island may also carry higher contractor rates.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a typical residential fit-out project take to complete?</b><div>A standard apartment fit-out in {{LOC_THE}} generally takes between six and fourteen weeks, depending on the scope of work and material lead times. Larger villas or commercial fit-outs with bespoke elements can take considerably longer, so agreeing a clear timeline in your contract is essential.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check before accepting an interior design and fit-out quote?</b><div>Ensure the quote itemises labour, materials, and project management fees separately, and confirms whether VAT at 5% is included. Also verify that the contractor holds a valid Dubai Municipality or relevant emirate trade licence and that the quote specifies a payment schedule tied to project milestones rather than large upfront lump sums.</div></div></section><section><h2>Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/interior-design-in-dubai/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design-in-abu-dhabi/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design-in-sharjah/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design-in-ajman/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design-in-fujairah/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a><a href=\"/services/pest-control/\">Pest Control</a></div></section></div>",
