"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>AC Duct Cleaning in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted ac duct cleaning suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get ac duct cleaning quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-ac-duct-cleaning-uae/\">typical AC Duct Cleaning prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>AC duct cleaning involves the thorough removal of dust, debris, mould, and allergens that accumulate inside your air conditioning ductwork over time. It is particularly relevant in {{LOC_THE}}, where fine desert sand and high humidity can clog ducts quickly, reducing airflow and air quality. Villas, apartments, and commercial premises in emirates such as Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Sharjah typically benefit from a professional clean every one to two years. The cost and scope depend on the number of vents, duct length, system type, and the degree of contamination. With QuotesDone, you can describe your requirements and receive several competitive quotes from vetted AC specialists — completely free — so you can compare and choose with confidence.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Inspection and assessment of all supply and return air ducts</li><li>High-powered vacuuming and brushing of duct interiors to remove dust and debris</li><li>Cleaning and sanitising of all vent grilles and diffusers</li><li>Mould and bacteria treatment using approved antimicrobial agents</li><li>Air handler unit and drip tray cleaning</li><li>Post-clean airflow check and written service report</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>AC Duct Cleaning in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of AC duct cleaning in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Pricing is mainly influenced by the number of vents and ducts, the size of the property, and the level of contamination — heavily soiled or mould-affected systems take longer and may require specialist treatments. Larger villas or commercial spaces in areas like Dubai Marina or Abu Dhabi will generally cost more than a standard one-bedroom apartment.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does an AC duct cleaning service typically take?</b><div>For a standard two- to three-bedroom apartment, the job usually takes between two and four hours; larger villas or commercial units can take a full day. The technician will give you a more accurate estimate once they have assessed the number of ducts and the system layout.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I look for when comparing AC duct cleaning quotes?</b><div>Check that the quote specifies the number of vents covered, the cleaning method used (mechanical brushing with HEPA vacuuming is the industry standard), and whether sanitisation is included. Also confirm that the company's technicians are trained and that the service comes with a written report, as this is important for landlord or tenancy requirements.</div></div></section><section><h2>AC Duct Cleaning across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/ac-duct-cleaning-in-dubai/\">AC Duct Cleaning in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/ac-duct-cleaning-in-abu-dhabi/\">AC Duct Cleaning in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/ac-duct-cleaning-in-sharjah/\">AC Duct Cleaning in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/ac-duct-cleaning-in-ajman/\">AC Duct Cleaning in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/ac-duct-cleaning-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">AC Duct Cleaning in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/ac-duct-cleaning-in-fujairah/\">AC Duct Cleaning in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/ac-duct-cleaning-in-umm-al-quwain/\">AC Duct Cleaning in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a></div></section></div>",
