"html": "<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></div><h1>Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets in {{LOC_THE}}</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get free, no-obligation quotes from vetted joinery &amp; kitchen cabinets suppliers across {{LOC_THE}}. Describe your job once — compare multiple quotes in one place.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Get free quotes →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Quick answer:</b> To get joinery &amp; kitchen cabinets quotes in {{LOC_THE}}, describe your job once on QuotesDone — it is sent anonymously to vetted {{LOC_THE}} suppliers who send comparable quotes you review side by side. Posting is free; you pay a 3% fee only when you reveal the supplier you choose.</div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"tldr\"><b>Budgeting?</b> See <a href=\"/blog/cost-of-kitchen-uae/\">typical Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets prices in {{LOC_THE}} →</a></div></div><div class=\"wrap\"><section><p>Joinery and kitchen cabinet work covers the design, manufacture, and installation of bespoke or semi-custom cabinetry, shelving, wardrobes, and fitted furniture throughout your home or commercial space. In {{LOC_THE}}, homeowners in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and Sharjah frequently commission full kitchen refits, villa joinery packages, or individual cabinet upgrades to suit modern or traditional interiors. Costs vary considerably depending on materials — from moisture-resistant MDF and plywood to solid wood or lacquered finishes — as well as cabinet configuration, hardware quality, and the complexity of the layout. Worktop choices, soft-close mechanisms, and integrated lighting all add to the final scope. By comparing several free quotes through QuotesDone, you can evaluate different suppliers on quality, lead time, and value before committing.</p></section><section><h2>What you can request</h2><ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Supply and installation of bespoke kitchen base and wall cabinets</li><li>Worktop fitting in granite, quartz, laminate, or solid surface materials</li><li>Wardrobe and built-in storage unit fabrication and installation</li><li>TV unit, display shelving, and living room joinery</li><li>Bathroom vanity unit and mirror cabinet installation</li><li>Finishing works including handles, soft-close hinges, and interior lighting</li></ul></section><section><h2>How QuotesDone works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1. Describe your job</b><div>Tell our smart engine what you need — by text, voice, photo or drawing. It builds a clear request.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2. Get matched quotes</b><div>We send it to relevant {{LOC_THE}} suppliers and collect their quotes for you to compare.</div></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3. Reveal &amp; hire</b><div>Compare prices and scope side-by-side, then reveal the supplier you want and deal directly.</div></div></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/app\">Start your request →</a></section><section><h2>Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets in {{LOC_THE}} — FAQs</h2><div class=\"faq\"><b>What factors affect the cost of kitchen cabinets in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>The main cost drivers are the material chosen (MDF, plywood, or solid wood), the cabinet finish (vinyl wrap, lacquer, or veneer), hardware quality, and the overall size and layout of the kitchen. Custom designs with island units or integrated appliances will increase the price compared with straightforward linear layouts.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>How long does a full kitchen cabinet installation typically take in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Most joinery workshops require two to four weeks for fabrication after designs are approved, with on-site installation taking between two and five days depending on kitchen size and complexity. Factoring in delivery and any remedial plastering or tiling, allow four to six weeks from order to completion.</div></div><div class=\"faq\"><b>What should I check when comparing joinery quotes in {{LOC_THE}}?</b><div>Ensure each quote specifies the board thickness, brand of hardware, type of finish, and whether installation and waste removal are included. Also confirm the warranty offered on both materials and workmanship, as reputable {{LOC}} suppliers typically provide one to three years' coverage.</div></div></section><section><h2>Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets across {{LOC_THE}}</h2><div class=\"links\"><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens-in-dubai/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets in Dubai</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens-in-abu-dhabi/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets in Abu Dhabi</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens-in-sharjah/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets in Sharjah</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens-in-ajman/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets in Ajman</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens-in-ras-al-khaimah/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets in Ras Al Khaimah</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens-in-fujairah/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets in Fujairah</a><a href=\"/services/joinery-kitchens-in-umm-al-quwain/\">Joinery &amp; Kitchen Cabinets in Umm Al Quwain</a></div></section><section><h2>Other services on QuotesDone</h2><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"/services/electrical/\">Electrical Work &amp; Contractors</a><a href=\"/services/plumbing/\">Plumbing Services</a><a href=\"/services/ac-maintenance/\">AC Repair &amp; Maintenance</a><a href=\"/services/cleaning/\">Cleaning Services</a><a href=\"/services/interior-design/\">Interior Design &amp; Fit-Out</a><a href=\"/services/waterproofing/\">Waterproofing Services</a><a href=\"/services/tiling-marble/\">Tiling &amp; Marble Work</a><a href=\"/services/pest-control/\">Pest Control</a></div></section></div>",
