`docs/phases/` — `PHASE1_REPORT.md`, `PHASE1_HARDENING_REPORT.md`, `PHASE1_FINAL_ACTIONS.md`.
`docs/security/` — `WI-001-inbound-secret-separation.md`, `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SETUP.md`.
